      <span class="text-sm">🌸 Official Tribute to the World's Sweetest Human 🌸</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title -->
    <h1 class="font-fredoka font-bold text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl leading-tight mb-4 tracking-tight">
      For <span class="shimmer-text underline decoration-pink-300 decoration-wavy decoration-2">Kenzie</span>,
